<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that Moore Corp and Morrison Fresh Cooking Inc were not available for after-hours trading for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA, Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA and Edison Brothers Stores Inc were also unavailable, it said.</p>
